      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm drafting some new company policy stuff for our employee handbook and wanted to get your take. do you think moving to a policy of using gender-neutral pronouns in all our professional comms is actually good for workplace culture, or does it just end up being confusing and making some people feel left out of the loop? turn it into and list for me. weight the pluses and",
